# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output and dependencies
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# devbox's nix profile
.devbox/

# Agent scratch space — /to-tickets and /prototype use this for anything not on the
# issue tracker. Nothing here is a primary source; don't commit it.
.scratch/

# Agent worktrees. A harness that runs work on a branch puts a whole second checkout
# here — `biome.json` and all — and Biome refuses at a nested root configuration, so
# `pnpm run lint` fails in the checkout that has one, naming a directory you are not
# in. Ignoring it is the whole fix, because every other ignore file follows this one
# (ADR-0068). `.claude/skills` is tracked and stays tracked: git does not ignore a file
# it already has.
.claude/worktrees/

# Where the `MediaStorage` kobai ships writes a Merchant's uploads, when nothing points it
# somewhere else. It is runtime data rather than anything a checkout generates — but a
# `pnpm run up` or a `pnpm run dev` in this repository does produce it, so `git status`
# should not report an image somebody uploaded to their own machine as an untracked file.
kobai-media/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
*.swp
.idea/
